<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">查询网址：</span><a href="https://rs.hrss.wuxi.gov.cn:8026/Home/ExamHome?examid=02260316193112">https://rs.hrss.wuxi.gov.cn:8026/Home/ExamHome?examid=02260316193112</a></span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">咨询电话：</span>0510--81880029</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">复查要求：</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">1、应考人员对考试成绩如有疑问，可以凭成绩核查申请表及准考证向当地人事考试部门申请复查成绩。</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">2.、复查试卷的内容包括：应考人员的相关信息是否准确；登分、核分是否正确；有无漏改、错改；是否有违纪记录或者其它异常情况等。对主观题评卷的宽严幅度不在复查范围之内，不作为变更成绩的依据。</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:10.5000pt;text-indent:-10.5000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">3、复查</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:宋体;">申请</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">时间：应考人员对考试成绩如有异议，</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:宋体;">请</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">在</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:宋体;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体;">月</span><span style="font-family:helvetica;">11</span><span style="font-family:宋体;">日至</span><span style="font-family:helvetica;">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体;">月</span><span style="font-family:helvetica;">13</span><span style="font-family:宋体;">日（</span><span style="font-family:helvetica;">9</span><span style="font-family:宋体;">：</span><span style="font-family:helvetica;">30~16:00</span><span style="font-family:宋体;">）</span></span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">向所在考区人事考试中心申请复查。</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">4、人事考试</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:宋体;">部门将</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">申请复查名单汇总上报江苏省人事考试中心，对同一考试科目的成绩复查，其复查工作原则上只受理一次。</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">5、江苏省人事考试中心将严格按有关规定进行复查，如实准确记录复查试卷的情况并将复查结果反馈给考生所在考区。</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">6、无锡考区考生递交成绩复查申请材料地址：无锡市梁溪区广瑞路2号人力资源市场1号楼405室（不接受快递及网上申请）。</span></span></span></p>

<p style="margin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;"><span style="letter-spacing:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;"><span style="font-family:helvetica;">附件：</span></span></span><a href="/uploadfiles/202605/09/2026050915080825389930.doc" target="_blank" title="无锡市2026年事业编笔试成绩复查申请表.doc">无锡市2026年事业编笔试成绩复查申请表.doc</a></p>
